# `-text` disables git's end-of-line conversion in BOTH directions, so a
# checkout on Windows cannot introduce CRLF into a prompt. The pack loader
# rejects a carriage return outright (`language_runtime/card_source.py`), so
# without this a Windows clone would simply fail to start rather than
# mysteriously misbehave -- but failing to start is not the goal either.
language_packs/**/cards/**/*.txt -text
